==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 2000 series|2000 series]] (8-car sets)
** The primary fleet for the line, introduced in 2008. These trains feature longitudinal seating and LCD passenger information screens.
* [[Yonekyu Corporation|Yonekyu]] 6000 series (8-car sets)
** Private railway stock used for through-services. These trains feature transverse seating suitable for the longer suburban runs into the inland Yonezawa region.

